  46:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     *
  47:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * \brief Sets the drive mode for each of the Pins component's pins.
  48:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * 
  49:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * <b>Note</b> This affects all pins in the Pins component instance. Use the
  50:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * Per-Pin APIs if you wish to control individual pin's drive modes.
  51:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     *
  52:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * <b>Note</b> USBIOs have limited drive functionality. Refer to the Drive Mode
  53:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     * parameter for more information.
  54:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c ****     *
