 220:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** * \brief Clears any active interrupts attached with the component and returns 
 221:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  the value of the interrupt status register allowing determination of which
 222:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  pins generated an interrupt event.
