 224:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** * \return 
 225:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  The right-shifted current value of the interrupt status register. Each pin 
 226:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  has one bit set if it generated an interrupt event. For example, bit 0 is 
 227:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  for pin 0 and bit 1 is for pin 1 of the Pins component.
 228:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  
 229:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** * \sideeffect
 230:.\Generated_Source\PSoC4/VCONN_MON_P2.c **** *  Clears all bits of the physical port's interrupt status register, not just
